			"notes": "# Adaptive Server Core (ASC) v1.0.0\n\nAdaptive Server Core is a high-performance, real-time adaptive server optimization plugin for Minecraft Paper, Purpur, Folia, and Spigot servers.\n\n### 🌟 Key Highlights\n- **Universal Multi-Platform Support**: Paper (1.20–1.21+), Folia (Regionized Multi-threading), Paper Legacy (1.16–1.19), Spigot, and Bukkit.\n- **Dynamic Gradient Math**: Smooth PID control budget adjustment instead of abrupt threshold switching.\n- **Intelligent Entity Management**: Strict whitelist-protected despawning ensuring villagers, named mobs, tamed animals, and mythic mobs are never deleted.\n- **Lazy Chunk Simulation**: Catches up furnaces, crops, saplings, villager work cycles, and beehives upon chunk awaken.\n- **Watchdog Protection & Crash Prevention**: SQLite WAL metrics database, auto-recovery checkpoints, and zero data corruption.\n- **Chest GUI & PlaceholderAPI**: Interactive 54-slot GUI () with 8 custom PAPI expansion placeholders.\n\n### 📦 Artifacts Included\n- : The all-in-one universal jar with runtime platform detection (Recommended).\n- : Dedicated optimized build for Paper 1.21+ and Folia.\n- : Dedicated build for Paper 1.16–1.19 servers.\n- : Dedicated Spigot fallback build.\n- : Dedicated Bukkit baseline build."
		}
	],
